{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221510","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221510","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1322151001:1":{"text":"Acolyte Maxim, it seems that you've been promoted to become the person in charge here.","source_cn":"马克西姆修士，看来你升职成为这里的负责人了，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D61ABE841CA7BC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322151002:1":{"text":"Ah, well, yes. I'm not sure how far I can go. I just hope I don't disappoint Dame Temesia's expectations...","source_cn":"啊……是的。真不知道我能做到什么程度，我只希望自己不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE57FD13AF9659C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1322151002":{"text":"Ah, well, yes. I'm not sure how far I can go. I just hope I don't disappoint Dame Temesia's expectations...","source_cn":"啊……是的。真不知道我能做到什么程度，我只希望自己不要辜负特弥希娅大人的期待……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE57FD13AF9659C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322151003:1":{"text":"Thank you for your kind words.","source_cn":"谢谢你们的祝福！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52BC61CCA29AF4C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322151004:1":{"text":"By the way... I actually wanted to ask if there are still undead in need of purification, would you be willing to come help?","source_cn":"对了……如果，呃，我是说如果，还有活死人需要净化的话，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE51599760CB67339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322151005:1":{"text":"No, never mind. I can't keep depending on you. I must work harder to master the power of the Divine Light and truly shoulder this sacred duty.","source_cn":"不对不对，我不能总想着依靠你们，我得更加努力研修圣光之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x815EDC98F805D83A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322151006:1":{"text":"I want to thank you for your help during this time. May Dura bless you all.","source_cn":"各位朋友，谢谢你们这段时间的帮助，愿艾雅保佑你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB27881B034938D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"You'll do well.","source_cn":"你会做得很好的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD34EFFD1000329CB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You'll do well.","female":"You'll do well.","variant_male_record_index":"69532","variant_female_record_index":"69533","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"Good luck!","source_cn":"加油！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x67EFE8A52E6F6238","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Good luck!","female":"Good luck!","variant_male_record_index":"69534","vari